    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525350/extras/0b65a3568523a16d774df9d430ceb52c.avif?t=1752510424\" data-has-big width=800 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild Space is a <strong>turn-based strategy game</strong> where dice rolls determine your luck, but <strong>it's up to you how you use it</strong>. Use your dices wisely and be the quickest ship in space. Choose your path carefully and upgrade your ship along the way. Outwit your opponents and master the dice to claim victory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525350/extras/03f9820c7fc78b672c66e656051a6992.avif?t=1752510424\" data-has-big width=800 height=173 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beggining of every new game, you can choose which systems of the ship you want to upgrade!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525350/extras/7787be3c7b61b8598bdaecca75975509.avif?t=1752510424\" data-has-big width=800 height=449 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525350/extras/9d9deff8733709fd9dca660f1e334a22.avif?t=1752510424\" data-has-big width=800 height=173 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching path will lead you to the final boss. Plan your route wisely in order to take the most advantageous path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525350/extras/ddac375653fa9545425d351afa4d7881.avif?t=1752510424\" data-has-big width=800 height=173 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't control the number of the dices, but you can pick and choose what to do with them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525350/extras/74854e4d7cf659ec21346448b50b9e5d.avif?t=1752510424\" data-has-big width=800 height=173 /></span>Along the galaxy you'll find special places where luck and strategy combine so you can level up your systems and have certain advantages in combat.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525350/extras/0b65a3568523a16d774df9d430ceb52c.avif?t=1752510424\" data-has-big width=800 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild Space is a <strong>turn-based strategy game</strong> where dice rolls determine your luck, but <strong>it's up to you how you use it</strong>. Use your dices wisely and be the quickest ship in space. Choose your path carefully and upgrade your ship along the way. Outwit your opponents and master the dice to claim victory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525350/extras/03f9820c7fc78b672c66e656051a6992.avif?t=1752510424\" data-has-big width=800 height=173 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beggining of every new game, you can choose which systems of the ship you want to upgrade!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525350/extras/7787be3c7b61b8598bdaecca75975509.avif?t=1752510424\" data-has-big width=800 height=449 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525350/extras/9d9deff8733709fd9dca660f1e334a22.avif?t=1752510424\" data-has-big width=800 height=173 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching path will lead you to the final boss. Plan your route wisely in order to take the most advantageous path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525350/extras/ddac375653fa9545425d351afa4d7881.avif?t=1752510424\" data-has-big width=800 height=173 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't control the number of the dices, but you can pick and choose what to do with them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525350/extras/74854e4d7cf659ec21346448b50b9e5d.avif?t=1752510424\" data-has-big width=800 height=173 /></span>Along the galaxy you'll find special places where luck and strategy combine so you can level up your systems and have certain advantages in combat.</p>",
